1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:04,060
Macam orang sakit, jamaklah sembahyang.

2
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:05,890
Sakit,

3
00:00:06,510 --> 00:00:08,060
kalau sakit ringan-ringan.

4
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:11,010
Orang sakit

5
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:14,170
ni, kita kena sembahyang juga.

6
00:00:14,170 --> 00:00:14,875
Ingat?

7
00:00:14,875 --> 00:00:18,890
Jangan ingat, sakit tak payah sembahyang.

8
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:22,260
Selagi ada akal, selagi itulah kena

9
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:22,820
sembahyang.

10
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:25,260
Kalau dah nyanyuk,

11
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:27,670
itu tak wajib sembahyang.

12
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:30,500
Dia hilang syarat wajib,

13
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:32,280
sembahyangnya tak ada, maka tak

14
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:33,420
wajib dah sembahyang.

15
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:36,070
Selagi ada syarat wajib sembahyang

16
00:00:36,070 --> 00:00:37,580
pada dia, dia wajib sembahyang.

17
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:41,380
Dia akil, dia baligh, dia berakal,

18
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:43,020
dia mesti kena sembahyang.

19
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:46,580
Kalau nyanyuk itu tak wajib sembahyang.

20
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:49,940
Katalah, ahli keluarga kita nyanyuk.

21
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:51,740
Ini dipaksa-paksa dia sembahyang.

22
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:54,130
Kalau sekadar suruh-suruh untuk dia

23
00:00:54,130 --> 00:00:55,260
buat, tak apalah.

24
00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:57,580
Tapi kalau dia tiga ke empat

25
00:00:57,580 --> 00:00:58,860
ke, empat dia itu tak apalah.

26
00:00:58,860 --> 00:01:00,660
Yang pentingnya dia buat yang dia

27
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:01,980
kena sembahyang.

28
00:01:01,980 --> 00:01:03,980
Sebenarnya dia pun dah tak wajib dah.

29
00:01:04,460 --> 00:01:06,500
Sebab dia pun dah hilang akal dia.

30
00:01:07,900 --> 00:01:08,900
Tak wajib dah.

31
00:01:09,420 --> 00:01:10,630
Tapi kalau kita sahaja-sahaja nak

32
00:01:10,630 --> 00:01:12,140
suruh dia, tak ada masalah.

33
00:01:12,140 --> 00:01:14,420
Supaya dia ingat, insya-Allah dia pulih.
